  </ul>
  <p class="muted">
    Site mirror of the skill markdown (same content): kept under
    <code>landing/src/content/docs/setup-harness.md</code> in the repo for editors.
  </p>

  <h2 id="after">What to do after the harness is in</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Work only in this folder with Claude Code.</li>
    <li>Before calling something “done”, run the relevant <code>./checks/…</code> script.</li>
    <li>If the model drifts, fix the check or tighten one line in <code>CLAUDE.md</code> — do not add 50 skills.</li>
    <li>When L0/L1 feel solid, read <a href="/docs/levels">levels</a> for optional L2 tools.</li>
  </ol>

  <div class="callout grow">
